  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 406.25 Water Quality Monitoring Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 406.25 Water Quality Monitoring Plan. The water quality monitoring plan required by Env- Dw 406.22(f)(12) shall:\n\n(a) Identify recommended operational raw water test parameters and sampling frequencies; and\n\n(b) Identify recommended operational finished water test parameters and sampling frequencies in addition to compliance monitoring required in accordance with Env-Dw 701 through 719, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 406) #10613, eff 6-1-14; ss by #14158, eff 12-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 406.24)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw400.html"
